    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t he gelefde, gif he his honda \u00d0a eode se bisscop \u00f0yder in to him & hiene neah for\u00f0fore geseah, & \u00f0a men ealle unrote \u00f0a \u00fee \u00dea sang he orationes ofer hiene & hiene gebl\u00e6tsade & ges\u00e6gnade. & \u00f0a ut he gan wolde, \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he \u00fe\u00e6t gewunelice word \u00fe\u00e6ra frefrendra: Truma \u00feec hr\u00e6\u00f0e & \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00e6fter \u00feissum \u00fea hio \u00e6t beode s\u00e6ton & \u00e6t sw\u00e6sendum, \u00f0a sende se untruma man to his \u00dea w\u00e6s he swi\u00f0e gefeonde \u00fe\u00e6t he drincan meahte: sende him gl\u00e6sfulne wines, & \u00fe\u00e6t se biscop Sona swa he hit gedruncen h\u00e6fde, swa aras he instepe & \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan untrumnesse getrumad w\u00e6s, & he eode in to \u00feam biscope & hiene grette & \u00fea ymbsittend, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hine lyste mid him etan Hehton hiene sittan mid him to sw\u00e6sendum, & swi\u00f0e gefeonde w\u00e6ron be his gesynto & h\u00e6lo. S\u00e6t he & sw\u00e6sendo \u00feeah & dronc & blissede mid him; & monig gear \u00e6fter \u00feissum lifde, & in \u00deis wundor se gemyndgeda abud s\u00e6gde \u00f0\u00e6t hit ne w\u00e6re him ondweardum \u00feus geworden, ah Nis \u00f0\u00e6t wundor to forswugianne, \u00fe\u00e6t Herebald se Cristes \u00feeow s\u00e6gde from him ge \u00f0\u00e6t eac W\u00e6s he \u00f0a in his gef\u00e6rscipe drohtigende, & eft w\u00e6s abbud in \u00f0\u00e6m mynstre \u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6m gemyndum Cw\u00e6\u00f0 he: \u00f0\u00e6s",
